{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2023-01-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'CITIZENS IS OFFICIAL SPONSOR OF HOUSE OF BLUES BOSTON', 'text': 'BOSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CITIZENS AND FENWAY MUSIC COMPANY TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BANK HAS BECOME THE FIRST OFFICIAL TITLE SPONSOR OF THE ICONIC HOUSE OF BLUES BOSTON, LOCATED ON LANSDOWNE STREET IN THE FENWAY AREA. CITIZENS HOUSE OF BLUES BOSTON BECOMES THE FIFTH SPONSORED VENUE UNDER THE CITIZENS LIVE BANNER.'}